Inclusion Criteria:
  -  Being older than 18 ;
  -  have a diagnosis of HIV;
  -  present at least one of the following symptoms during the preceding two weeks: sleep problems, [OR]  fatigue, [OR]  pain, [OR]  anxiety  [OR] or symptoms of depression;
  -  understand and speak French and;
  -  be able to follow the instructions to learn the relaxation technique
